cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AstroSpec: A unified library of spectral models for astronomy"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Md. Khairul"
    family-names: Islam
    affiliation: University of Virginia
repository-code: "https://github.com/khairulislam/AstroSpec"
url: "https://github.com/khairulislam/AstroSpec"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22119178
abstract: >-
  AstroSpec collects spectroscopic architectures and foundation
  models for astronomy under one registry and a common PyTorch
  interface. The models handle spectral classification, redshift
  estimation, stellar property estimation, and self-supervised
  representation learning on native instrument grids.
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - astrophysics
  - deep-learning
  - spectroscopy
  - pytorch
  - foundation-models
  - redshift
  - stellar-parameters
license: MIT
version: v0.1.0
